close_reason: "Removed generation-time wall-clock defaults; explicit version/date releases remain dated, version-only and timestamp-less pending headings are deterministic and undated. Plain resolveReleaseTagWindows arrays now carry non-enumerable suppression identity into createChangelog without changing the array return contract; explicit detailed resolutions remain available for copied or serialized windows. Accidental empty arrays still preserve all items. Anchored linked regressions passed 3/3 and each was proven red on exact fix-hunk revert. Final gates: typecheck passed; npm test 541/541; coverage 100/100/100; docstring 182/182; pm health strict ok with 3 advisory provenance warnings."
body: ""
